内容说明 / Content note:

The theoretical framework referenced by this project (共演战略 / Co-Evolution
Strategy, including the four elements, four stages, twelve strategic points,
48 evolutions, 5W1H questions and the dual S-curve) originates from the work
of Professor LU Jiangyong (路江涌), Peking University Guanghua School of
Management, and is used here for non-commercial educational purposes. This
project is not an official product of the author or the publisher.
